-- Select Hinges (Select Products Limited) in the catalogue, 2026-10-09.
-- Every model Select publishes a spec sheet for at https://www.select-hinges.com/specifications/spec-sheets,
-- read 2026-10-09: the model and hinge type are from the sheet's own first page. Each sheet is a
-- cut_sheet document with its source URL; weyland-cutsheetx-worker's corpus job fetches it into R2 at
-- catalog-corpus/<sha256(url)>.pdf (the r2_object_key below), so a packet can cite its page 1.
-- Applied with .github/workflows/d1-apply.yml. Re-running is harmless (INSERT OR IGNORE).
